> VERSION 1.0.0 — Tauri rebuild

The React Native/Expo prototype has been replaced by a Tauri 2 desktop app
with a React frontend and a Rust audio engine.

- Native audio decoding (MP3, FLAC, WAV, OGG, M4A/AAC/ALAC, AIFF, CAF, ...)
- Video playback through the system webview
- Folder library, drag and drop, metadata and cover art
- Album/artist views, queue, shuffle, repeat, keyboard shortcuts
- No database: library and preferences are stored locally
